hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1420","Muhammad bin Bashar told us, Othman bin Omar told us, Ibn Abi Dhib told us, on the authority of Al-Zuhri, on the authority of Abbad bin Tamim, on the authority of his uncle that The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, “went out to draw water, faced the Qiblah, and the people turned their backs to him, turned his robe inside out, and prayed two rak’ahs. He recited in them, and recite them aloud.”"
